# Keep the Vercel build container lean and make it structurally
# impossible for secrets or local junk to land in the upload.
#
# tenants/ was REQUIRED before the project move; projects/ is REQUIRED now
# (agent.md, skills and migration files embed into the binary via
# projectembed.go), so re-include its markdown after the blanket *.md rule.
bin/
data/
/docs/
/shots/
/appendonlydir/
/.playwright-mcp/
/.commandcode/
/supabase/
/ops/
/scripts/
*.md
!projects/**/*.md
!tenants/**/*.md
*.png
*.log
*.rdb
.env
